    <data key="d0">BASF Cross-Account ML Model Deployment</data>
    <data key="d1">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DAJZAygxDZA</data>
    <data key="d2">Architecture for automated cross-account SageMaker model deployment using EXAMT serverless framework.</data>
